  "guidebook": {
    "intro": "Mu Lungereza okulamusa kumpi: “Hello” oba “Good morning”, “How are you?”, “I’m fine, thank you.” Ekitundu kino kikuyigiriza okulamusa, okweyanjula n’okubala okutuuka ku kkumi.",
