    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "greetings-clock",
        "title": "Okulamusa kugoberera essaawa",
        "body": [
          "Okutuusa mu ttuntu gamba **Good morning**. Okuva mu ttuntu okutuuka akawungeezi, **Good afternoon**. Akawungeezi n’ekiro, **Good evening**.",
          "**How are you?** kikola essaawa yonna. Okuddamu okwa bulijjo kwe **I’m fine, thank you.**"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i-am",
        "title": "“I” ne “I am”",
        "body": [
          "Mu Luganda “nze” n’ekikolwa bigattibwa: **ndi** kitegeeza “I am”. Mu Lungereza ebigambo biba bibiri: **I** (nze) ne **am** (ndi).",
          "**I** bulijjo kiwandiikibwa n’ennukuta ennene. **I am** bangi bakimpimpisa nga **I’m**."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "you-one-many",
        "title": "“You” ku muntu omu n’abangi",
        "body": [
          "Mu Luganda ogamba **Weebale** eri omuntu omu ne **Mwebale** eri abangi. Mu Lungereza **Thank you** kye kimu ku bombi, era **you** kye kimu ku muntu omu n’abangi."
        ],
        "table": [
          ["Lungereza", "Omuntu omu", "Abantu bangi"],
          ["Thank you", "Weebale", "Mwebale"],
          ["Goodbye", "Weraba", "Mweraba"],
          ["Good morning", "Wasuze otya?", "Mwasuze mutya?"]
        ],
        "targetColumns": [0]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Olungereza mu Uganda",
        "body": [
          "Olungereza lwe lulimi lw’eggwanga mu Uganda. Lukozesebwa mu masomero, mu ofiisi, mu kkooti ne mu mawulire, era lwe luyunga abantu aboogera ennimi ez’enjawulo."
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Okulamusa okumpi",
        "body": [
          "Aboogera Olungereza batera okulamusa mu bigambo bitono: **Hi!** oba **Hello!** Si bubi; bwe batyo bwe bakola. Mu Uganda, abantu era bagamba **Well done** eri omuntu akola, nga Gyebale ko."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
